---
import OptimizedImage from "../../../components/OptimizedImage.astro";
---
<div class="w-full"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/49037c276be7.webp" alt="Cover" width="2400" height="1048" class="block w-full h-auto" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" /></div>

    <article class="px-6 mb:px-16 dt:px-35 pt-10">
      <header>
        <h1 class="font-extrabold text-2xl mb:text-[32px] leading-10">Hasu wearing shorts - 2019</h1>
        <p class="mt-3 text-[18px] leading-6 font-medium">イラスト：Thuy An</p>
      </header>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[16px] leading-6 font-normal text-pretty wrap-break-word">この絵本は、ハスという男の子とその冒険を描いた全4巻シリーズの一冊です。文章は Trang Kyu が担当し、イラストを私が担当しました。</p>

      <section class="mt-14 mb:mt-16" aria-label="Artwork">
        <h2 class="sr-only">作品</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 dt:grid-cols-2 gap-10 mb:gap-12.5 items-start">
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/90ec66e69a0c.webp" alt="Artwork 1" width="1184" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/cacc48fddb1e.webp" alt="Artwork 2" width="1200" height="1184" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/ac70db6c0296.webp" alt="Artwork 3" width="1200" height="1184" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/66233ef8b718.webp" alt="Artwork 4" width="1200" height="1196" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/077a12457fc7.webp" alt="Artwork 5" width="1130" height="1130" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/0d15ee9cd08f.webp" alt="Artwork 6" width="1134" height="1142" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/aff1839dd9b6.webp" alt="Artwork 7" width="1194" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/68924110f00e.webp" alt="Artwork 8" width="1126" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/38f642692e0a.webp" alt="Artwork 9" width="1102" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/bc5155e82080.webp" alt="Artwork 10" width="1120" height="1200" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        <div class="w-full mx-auto max-w-122.5"><OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/582498dc15d8.webp" alt="Artwork 11" width="1200" height="918" class="block w-full h-auto rounded-md" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div>
        </div>
        </section>

      <div class="mt-18 mb:mt-22 flex flex-col items-center gap-10 mb:gap-11">
        <OptimizedImage src="/assets/images/work/b251388c4647.webp" alt="Closing illustration" width="1200" height="1124" class="block w-50 h-50 mb:w-62.5 mb:h-62.5 rounded-full object-cover object-center mx-auto" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <p class="font-extrabold text-2xl mb:text-[32px] leading-10 text-center">ご覧いただき、ありがとうございました！</p>
      </div>

      <a href="/jp/illustration" id="back-link" class="img-btn block w-34 h-6.5 mt-17 mb-21 bg-left!" style="background-image:url(/assets/icons/back.png)" aria-label="もどる" title="もどる"></a>
    </article>
